# `FLOWCHART-ROLE-KEYWORDS`: the role keywords live in the `flowchart` namespace ONLY (`GENRE-NAMESPACE` `GENRE-NAMESPACE`/`GENRE-VOCABULARY-OBLIGATION`),
# and every other rule that governs `node` governs them unchanged.
figdown 0.1 flowchart
process
decision 9bad "Nope"
terminator dup "One"
process dup "Two"
decision q unquoted
process p "P" shape=hexagon
terminator t "T" width=80
process x "X" description="not a node option"
